lass=\"italic\">Present Perfect Continuous tense</span> to emphasize the duration or continuous course of an action."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Form:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Form of <span class=\"italic\">have</span> + been + base form of verb + <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You emphasize the base form of verb + <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> when you speak."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: I've been <span class=\"strong\">planning</span> the party for two months.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read and compare the following sentences:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You've <span class=\\\"strong\\\">done</span> a great job.<br/>I've <span class=\\\"strong\\\">thought</span> a lot about what happened.<br/>I've <span class=\\\"strong\\\">told</span> the story many times.<br/>I've <span class=\\\"strong\\\">talked</span> to your father.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You've been <span class=\\\"strong\\\">doing</span> a great job.<br/>I've been <span class=\\\"strong\\\">thinking</span> about what happened lately.<br/>I've been <span class=\\\"strong\\\">telling</span> this story lately.<br/>I've been <span class=\\\"strong\\\">talking</span> to your father.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "culture"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the arts and other forms of human expression common to a group of people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My mother didn't know much a