": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Activity 1"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "You are done!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">\nListen to the audio. </span> <span class=\"bullet\"> Record EACH word and phrase. </span> <span class=\"bullet\">Compare yourself to the audio.</span>"}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": []}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"id": 0, "image": "engenn8le01ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"id": 1, "image": "engenn8le01ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Tell me more about your mother's adventure in Italy. You have been doing a great job telling the story. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: My mother didn't know that much about Italian culture, but she knew a lot about human nature.  My father lived in a tight-knit community.  She knew people would react negatively if she arrived uninvited at his home. She also knew my father was a creature of habit. He would always stop for an espresso at the same coffee shop on his way home from work."}, {"id": 2, "image": "engenn8le01ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "26500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So she went to the coffee shop!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: No.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What do you mean? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: I've thought a lot about what happened next. My mother knew a fortune teller lived in town. She went to see her and explained the situation. She told her about some of the romantic experiences they had shared, like admiring ancient sculptures. She explained how sad she felt. Then, she gave the fortune teller directions to the coffee shop. What do you think happened next?"}, {"id": 3, "image": "engenn8le01ob04re2img02.jpg", "time": "56200", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: The fortune teller talked to your father.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: Exactly. The next day, at the precise hour, the fortune teller introduced herself to my father. She told him she felt a strong message warning him to think carefully about what he wants in life. My father has never forgotten that day."}], "coverimg": "engenn8le01ob04re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le01ob04re2aud01"}}], "title": "", "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": []}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}